  "htmlSnippet": "\n  <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F7F9FB] flex flex-col lg:flex-row\"><div class=\"hidden lg:flex lg:w-[55%] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0F6B6B] to-[#0a4f4f] text-white flex-col justify-between p-12 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-white/5 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-56 h-56 bg-white/5 rounded-full translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\"></div><div><button class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\"><img src=\"/logo.png\" alt=\"StockWatch PHC Logo\" class=\"w-11 h-11 object-contain rounded-xl bg-white p-0.5 shadow-sm\"><div><div class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">StockWatch PHC</div><div class=\"text-xs text-teal-200\">Medicine Supply Early-Warning</div></div></button></div><div class=\"space-y-4 relative z-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight\">One Network.<br>Smarter Medicine Supply.</h2><p class=\"text-teal-100 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">Predict shortages early. Coordinate supplies. Help keep essential medicines available across every Primary Health Centre.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 pt-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-teal-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-teal-300 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Velocity &amp; acceleration-based forecasting</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-teal-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-teal-300 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Seven role-specific dashboards</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-teal-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-teal-300 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Inter-facility transfer recommendations</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-teal-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-teal-300 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Offline stock-entry with auto-sync</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-teal-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-teal-300 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>English and Tamil interface</li></ul></div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-teal-300 font-semibold\">National Health Mission · Production Platform · SDG 3: Good Health &amp; Well-Being</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-12\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-md space-y-6\"><div class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[#5B6B7A] hover:text-[#14202B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>Back</button><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#0F6B6B] flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-pulse text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.22 13H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#14202B]\">StockWatch PHC</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#E3E8EE] shadow-xl p-8 space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#14202B]\">Sign in to your account</h1><p class=\"text-xs text-[#5B6B7A]\">Enter your registered email and password to continue.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#5B6B7A] uppercase tracking-wider\">Quick Role Selector (Verified Accounts)</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">Patient</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">Retail Pharmacist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">PHC Pharmacist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">CHC Officer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">District Officer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">State Officer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold rounded-full border border-[#E3E8EE] text-[#5B6B7A] hover:border-[#0F6B6B] hover:text-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-teal-50 transition-colors\">National Officer</button></div></div><form class=\"space-y-4\" novalidate=\"\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#14202B]\" for=\"login-email\">Username or Email</label><div class=\"relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#5B6B7A]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><input id=\"login-email\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"username\" placeholder=\"e.g. district_demo or district@demo.tn.gov.in\" class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-xl border bg-[#F7F9FB] text-[#14202B] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0F6B6B] focus:border-[#0F6B6B] transition-colors border-[#E3E8EE]\" value=\"\" style=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#14202B]\" for=\"login-pw\">Password</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-[11px] text-[#0F6B6B] hover:underline\">Forgot password?</button></div><div class=\"relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#5B6B7A]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><input id=\"login-pw\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" class=\"w-full pl-9 pr-10 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-xl border bg-[#F7F9FB] text-[#14202B] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0F6B6B] focus:border-[#0F6B6B] transition-colors border-[#E3E8EE]\" value=\"\" style=\"\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#5B6B7A] hover:text-[#14202B]\" aria-label=\"Show password\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></button></div></div><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-[#14202B] cursor-pointer select-none\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded border-[#E3E8EE] accent-[#0F6B6B]\" style=\"\">Remember me on this device</label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 bg-[#0F6B6B] hover:bg-[#0a4f4f] text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition-colors shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-60\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-log-in\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m10 17 5-5-5-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 12H3\"></path><path d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4\"></path></svg>Sign in</button></form><p class=\"text-xs text-center text-[#5B6B7A]\">Don't have an account? <button class=\"font-semibold text-[#0F6B6B] hover:underline\">Register here</button></p></div><p class=\"text-[10px] text-center text-[#5B6B7A] px-4 leading-relaxed\">StockWatch PHC is a decision-support tool. All replenishment actions require authorized officer approval. Forecasts are estimates.</p></div></div></div></div>\n  <script>\n    if ('serviceWorker' in navigator && window.location.protocol.startsWith('http')) {\n      window.addEventListener('load', () => {\n        navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch((err) => {\n          console.log('ServiceWorker registration skipped:', err);\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  </script>\n\n\n\n"
